        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, passenger car, diesel, EURO5, city car
The  data set reflects the maintenance of a light weight concept passenger car of 550kg, total weight, diesel engine;
UUID: c2293bb9-f020-30d5-b4db-13b1a3981ffc
This data set includes material and energy use for passenger car maintenance.
Location: Data from a German company but also valid for Europe.
Technology: Diesel car, 550 kg, light weight concept car
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: All values extrapolated from average passenger car manufacture according to weight ratio
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c2293bb9-f020-30d5-b4db-13b1a3981ffc.xml</text>
